          "options": {
            "raw": { "language": "json" }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/payments/webhook/moyasar",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "payments", "webhook", "moyasar"]
        },
        "description": "⚠️ IMPORTANT — এই request-এ No Auth লাগে (Moyasar directly call করে).\n\n🔑 Pre-request script automatically করে:\n  • HMAC-SHA256 signature generate\n  • x-moyasar-signature header set\n\n✅ Success হলে DB-তে:\n  • payments.status → 'paid'\n  • user_course_access তৈরি হবে (course হলে)\n\n⚠️ webhook_secret collection variable-এ .env এর MOYASAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET দিতে হবে।\n   খালি থাকলে signature mismatch হবে।"
